  "overall_subsumption_recommendation": "SUBSUMED: recommend no new-result credit for resolving universal Conjecture 4.9, by the published 2020 length-70 examples. The distinct length-12 witness and possible minimality claim are not shown previously published by this lane.",
  "questions": {
    "1": {
      "verdict": "UNRESOLVED",
      "subject": "Exact main Knapp-Schmid theorem statements",
      "finding": "Open arXiv 1711.10671v3, introduction pp.2-3, gives a precise secondary statement: for n > 6, if the permutation projection of the monomial automorphism group contains A_n, the code is equivalent to zero, the full space, repetition, or its dual. Small n exceptions and Mathieu cases are mentioned but not stated precisely. This does not produce a full free C2 action. The entire collection of exact main theorems was not obtained.",
      "evidence": [
        "bodies/modules2017.txt",
        "bodies/reedmuller1990.txt",
        "bodies/rodrigues.txt",
        "receipts/zb-citing.json",
        "receipts/openalex-citing-knapp.json",
