      ],
      "attempts": "zbMATH ci:3708246 returned one citing document, review withheld; OpenAlex returned 40 citing records; read selected open bodies; inspected author main and course pages. Publisher and denied zbMATH web page not retried.",
      "bridge_obstruction": "A_n containment/classification and Mathieu hypotheses do not establish the desired intransitive C2 representation; the full original paper remains unread."
    },
    "2": {
      "verdict": "UNRESOLVED",
      "subject": "Phelps 1985 construction and coordinate action",
      "finding": "Tonchev review confirms binary full abstract-group realization using graphs. No accessible construction was found. Cannot decide its coordinate set, fixed coordinates, or the action induced by a free graph involution.",
