        "receipts/small2025.html.receipt.json"
      ],
      "access_limits": "Preprints.org 202506.2100 returned 403; stopped entire route, did not try PDF variants. No denied publisher route retried.",
      "qualification": "Absence of a located later resolution is not a CLEARED verdict. Q3 already independently settles prior-art subsumption of the universal counterexample claim."
    }
